    "kind": "control",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**I have invented this box.** Nothing you have described says Argus waits, gives up, or notices. It may simply take whatever EDGAR returned by the time it got there.\n\nIf there is no cutoff, delete this and the flow becomes a straight line — which is itself the finding."
   },
